1
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:13,940
(This story is entirely fictional)

2
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,150
(Xu Meng)
Hey.

3
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,800
Xu Meng.

4
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,280
Custom-made just for you.

5
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,440
It's expensive.

6
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:31,720
(Based on Doctor Qin: Executer)
Mr. Zhang really likes it.

7
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:33,640
Look. How pretty.

8
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:37,560
You better not disappoint him.

9
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:39,440
Sir,

10
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,000
I don't wanna wear this.

11
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:43,800
What... what did you just say?

12
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:48,560
I... I don't want to.

13
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,240
Here, take it.

14
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,280
Here.

15
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,520
Say that again.

16
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:58,840
Come on.

17
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,960
Hurry up.

18
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,560
Mr. Zhang is waiting
to see you dance the starlight dance.

19
00:01:14,120 --> 00:01:14,920
Hurry up!

20
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,240
Hands down.

21
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:12,800
Meng!

22
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,600
Meng.

23
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:18,480
Meng.

24
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:20,160
Stay alive.

25
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,560
Surviving matters more than anything.

26
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,280
I'll definitely gather evidence

27
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,960
and make them pay.

28
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,200
I will.

29
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:34,360
I will.

30
00:02:40,060 --> 00:02:44,060
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 10=

31
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,320
Meng.

32
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,360
Su wants you.

33
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:06,600
What are you two whispering about

34
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:07,800
that I can't hear?

35
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:11,640
Xiaoxue isn't feeling well.

36
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,880
I'm taking her
to the guest room to rest.

37
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,440
You do look a bit pale.

38
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,360
You're not having low blood sugar,
are you?

39
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,760
Should I go get you some juice?

40
00:03:20,120 --> 00:03:20,920
No need.

41
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,160
The guest rooms have everything.

42
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,360
I'll take care of her.

43
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,840
You go entertain the guests.

44
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:27,720
Okay.

45
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,080
Get some good rest.

46
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:31,360
I'll call you two when I cut the cake.

47
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:33,600
You two can't miss me cutting the cake.

48
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:36,160
Xiaoya, happy birthday!

49
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:38,080
Let's take a photo together?

50
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:38,480
Sure.

51
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:39,400
Come on.

52
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,400
Come take a photo.

53
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,160
Coming.

54
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,040
Let's put our star in the center.

55
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:47,960
(Cheese.)

56
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,720
(Cheese.)

57
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,040
Jin Xiaoxue.

58
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:19,960
Mr. Wang really likes you.

59
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,440
He's especially happy

60
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,400
knowing you're here.

61
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:25,320
Come on!

62
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:28,400
Give Mr. Wang some entertainment.

63
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,000
Mr. Wang.

64
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,680
She really isn't feeling well.

65
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,640
How about I dance instead?

66
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,560
Who do you think you are?

67
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,520
Get lost.

68
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,800
Out.

69
00:05:26,310 --> 00:05:29,830
♪Shadows roll over the girl's wall♪

70
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:32,890
♪The sunset is nailed to the tombstone♪

71
00:05:33,300 --> 00:05:36,370
♪They say a cat has nine lives♪

72
00:05:36,370 --> 00:05:40,140
♪Guess how many lives
I've lived through♪

73
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:44,100
♪The fluorescent powder
tears the scars open♪

74
00:05:44,100 --> 00:05:46,900
♪Fresh blood feeds the crocodiles♪

75
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:50,700
♪They stroll down the hallway
with smirks♪

76
00:05:50,700 --> 00:05:55,630
♪When the prey breaks free,
the hunter masks up and runs♪

77
00:05:57,640 --> 00:06:01,490
♪Don't ask which hand
I settle scores with♪

78
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,020
Who... who's there?

79
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:08,320
Mr. Wang, you look good on camera.

80
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:12,160
Do you remember
what happened eight years ago?

81
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:15,440
Who are you?

82
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,440
What do you want?

83
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:22,760
Do you want me to post the video online,

84
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:26,080
or do you want to die
just like Zhang Xiaodong?

85
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,400
Mr. Wang.

86
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,240
You've got a son and a daughter.

87
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,600
Happy life.

88
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,200
What exactly do you want?

89
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,160
Do you think

90
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:48,760
they know what kind of man their dad is?

91
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,120
Come here.

92
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:01,440
It's you.

93
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,240
Sit down.

94
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:09,120
Mr. Wang,

95
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:11,400
you know what?

96
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,000
‌You can't see the fluorescent liquid

97
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,080
on the clothes during the day.

98
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:18,600
At night,

99
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:21,440
your whole body glows.

100
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,840
Girls like this color.

101
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,840
I've tried it.

102
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,400
Do you think

103
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:34,000
boys would like it?

104
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:39,040
Do you like it?

105
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:49,240
Like it?

106
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,160
Answer me!

107
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,240
You...

108
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,480
Name your price.

109
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:01,080
Fill it up.

110
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,400
Hurry up!

111
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:04,240
Okay.

112
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,400
Zhou.

113
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:11,400
I'm in the Diamond Room.

114
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,120
Bring me

115
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,840
five hundred thousand dollars.

116
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:16,760
Five hundred thousand.

117
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:18,600
Make it fast.

118
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,040
Don't ask why!

119
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,080
Just get it here fast!

120
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:22,360
You have fifteen minutes!

121
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,120
That's it!

122
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,920
So pretty.

123
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,840
Don't cry.

124
00:08:39,800 --> 00:08:41,960
You're not pretty when you cry.

125
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:44,080
All you do is cry!

126
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,760
Come in.

127
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,640
Mr. Wang, the money's here.

128
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:53,800
Get out.

129
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,280
What are you looking at?

130
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:17,200
Time's almost up.

131
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:30,960
Is that enough?

132
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:33,880
Good boy.

133
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:45,280
Oh, and Mr. Wang,

134
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,520
stop using this color.

135
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:50,920
It's ugly.

136
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,760
Mr. Dong.

137
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,400
Where's Han Liang?

138
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:06,280
He's out on a call.

139
00:10:06,400 --> 00:10:07,440
Fill me in.

140
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:10,000
We thoroughly checked all the accounts
and funding records

141
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,880
of the Sun Education Fund
over the past ten years.

142
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,600
It looked flawless.

143
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,760
But after deeper investigation,

144
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:18,320
we found they focused mainly
on remote areas.

145
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:20,240
They've been screening and funding girls

146
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,600
from extremely poor families

147
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:23,880
with no one to rely on.

148
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:26,080
He specifically targeted girls
in hardship.

149
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,520
A total scumbag.

150
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,480
We found three victims
who are now adults

151
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:31,440
and have left the city.

152
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,680
They all found the courage
to confirm to us

153
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:35,520
that Zhang Xiaodong
and his core assistants

154
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:38,000
would send funded girls
to Fengshan Villas

155
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,280
under the pretext of verifying info,

156
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,520
distributing cash,

157
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:42,040
or conducting one-on-one interviews.

158
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:44,280
Then they'd threaten
to cancel their eligibility,

159
00:10:44,280 --> 00:10:45,520
make their families repay the money,

160
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,760
or expose their poverty and privacy,

161
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:48,720
and sexually assault them.

162
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:51,080
And some victims were later
passed on by them,

163
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:52,640
under the guise of job referrals

164
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:55,000
or meeting important people,

165
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,240
to certain investors

166
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,600
or bosses with special needs.

167
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:01,280
This has become a shady industry.

168
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,600
Even more horrifying,

169
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,800
according to one victim,

170
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,840
Zhang Xiaodong has a habit
of keeping indecent videos.

171
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,840
And he files them by name

172
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:09,600
as a tool for long-term blackmail.

173
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:16,560
List all the victims' names.

174
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:18,480
Whether they're willing to
come forward now or not,

175
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,760
we need to let them know
the police station door

176
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,120
is always open to them.

177
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,560
Immediately apply to

178
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:25,800
fully freeze
the Sun Education Fund accounts.

179
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:27,040
Seal all materials.

180
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:29,600
And give the highest level of protection

181
00:11:29,880 --> 00:11:31,560
to confirmed victims and witnesses.

182
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:33,720
This lead

183
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,840
will be the strongest evidence
to bring down Zhang Xiaodong.

184
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:38,240
Yes, sir!

185
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:12,800
What time do you get off?

186
00:12:14,940 --> 00:12:16,380
(01:55)

187
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,360
Ten more minutes.

188
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:16,000
You haven't contacted me
in all these years.

189
00:13:16,000 --> 00:13:17,400
Am I that hard to reach?

190
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,560
Not hard.

191
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:20,560
Then what do you mean
by suddenly showing up now?

192
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:22,240
You weren't there
when I needed you most.

193
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:23,440
Now I don't need you anymore!

194
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:24,680
Stop coming to find me!

195
00:13:58,960 --> 00:13:59,760
Let's go.

196
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:00,600
Home?

197
00:14:00,770 --> 00:14:01,270
Yeah.

198
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:12,800
Didn't you say you'd drive me home?

199
00:14:15,360 --> 00:14:16,400
Do you remember?

200
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:18,640
Back in high school,

201
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:20,560
you bombed a mock exam once

202
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,000
and cried all night.

203
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:24,760
I remember.

204
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:26,760
That night,

205
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:28,840
I even wrote you a letter.

206
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:30,800
In the letter,

207
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:33,560
you said you probably wouldn't get
into Longfan University.

208
00:14:34,560 --> 00:14:35,800
You told me not to let you affect me.

209
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:38,760
Told me not to ignore you once I got in.

210
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,360
Do you think

211
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:44,040
I was really dumb back then?

212
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:46,000
No.

213
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:47,560
I thought

214
00:14:48,880 --> 00:14:49,680
it was cute.

215
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:52,080
If...

216
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:55,360
I mean, if.

217
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,560
If I hadn't

218
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:00,200
dropped out that year,

219
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:04,280
and we had both gotten
into Longfan University together,

220
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,360
what would it be like?

221
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:10,520
Maybe

222
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:13,240
you'd work part-time,

223
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:16,200
working at a convenience store till two,

224
00:15:17,040 --> 00:15:18,200
and I'd pick you up after your shift.

225
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,280
Like now?

226
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,600
Are you working
at the convenience store again tonight?

227
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:32,280
Will you come pick me up?

228
00:15:33,010 --> 00:15:33,630
Yeah.

229
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:41,960
If only it were real.

230
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:44,480
But it doesn't matter anymore.

231
00:15:58,680 --> 00:15:59,480
I'm home.

232
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:02,960
Keke.

233
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:05,480
Qin Ming.

234
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:08,000
Stop coming to find me.

235
00:16:09,940 --> 00:16:12,960
♪Back then, you and I turned away♪

236
00:16:14,090 --> 00:16:16,790
♪Silence swallowed the sound of crying♪

237
00:16:17,890 --> 00:16:21,330
♪Then I heard your name♪

238
00:16:21,740 --> 00:16:25,330
♪Like thunder hits my heart♪

239
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:28,830
♪The warmth I once kept hidden♪

240
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:32,800
♪Turned to dust♪

241
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:38,460
♪I love you,
but it's a love I'll never have♪

242
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:46,990
♪The wild wind swept away
all the warmth♪

243
00:16:47,870 --> 00:16:54,590
♪I love you,
but it's a love I'll never have♪

244
00:16:55,730 --> 00:17:00,580
♪When we meet again,
there's nothing but silence and tears♪

245
00:17:03,910 --> 00:17:08,210
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

246
00:17:08,670 --> 00:17:12,850
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

247
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:17,100
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

248
00:17:17,530 --> 00:17:21,380
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

249
00:17:30,350 --> 00:17:34,270
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

250
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:37,140
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

251
00:17:37,770 --> 00:17:41,380
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

252
00:17:41,380 --> 00:17:45,600
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

253
00:17:45,600 --> 00:17:50,340
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

254
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:54,660
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

255
00:17:55,350 --> 00:17:59,090
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

256
00:17:59,090 --> 00:18:03,260
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

257
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:16,380
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

258
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:20,710
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

259
00:18:20,710 --> 00:18:24,490
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

260
00:18:24,490 --> 00:18:27,400
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

261
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:32,190
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

262
00:18:32,190 --> 00:18:36,850
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

263
00:18:36,850 --> 00:18:39,150
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

264
00:18:39,150 --> 00:18:41,240
♪We stop here in this night♪

265
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:45,650
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

266
00:18:45,650 --> 00:18:51,550
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

267
00:18:54,040 --> 00:19:00,010
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

268
00:19:11,910 --> 00:19:18,900
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

269
00:19:21,110 --> 00:19:26,580
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪
